        "对于不是整数的平方的 $x$ 值，相应的函数值计算到小数点后",
        "面取两位."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
